spec ab06-create-delete-recreate-commit-lpg: 2 sessions, 6 permutations
# AB06 through the lpg API, commit arm (the lpg API has no rollback of eager
# writes). s1 adds z (v = 1), removes it, adds it again (v = 2), reads it and ends its
# transaction; s2 reads z at a fresh snapshot. z is visible once with v = 2 after the
# commit and absent before it.

starting permutation: s1c1 s1d s1c2 s1r s1c s2r
step s1c1: lpg: AddNode(z); SetNodeProperty(z, v, 1)
step s1d: lpg: RemoveNode(z)
step s1c2: lpg: AddNode(z); SetNodeProperty(z, v, 2)
step s1r: lpg: exists z, z.v
exists|v
------+-
true  |2
(1 row)
step s1c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s2r: lpg: exists z, z.v
exists|v
------+-
true  |2
(1 row)
final final: lpg: exists z, z.v
exists|v
------+-
true  |2
(1 row)

starting permutation: s1c1 s1d s1c2 s1r s2r s1c
